{"3127290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tiny Duck Hunt 3D", "steam_appid": 3127290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Duck Hunt 3D is not affiliated with, sponsored by, approved by, endorsed by, or in any way connected to Nintendo video game company or Duck Hunt (TM).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic hand eye coordination activity that's not as messy or too much when you want to relax and enjoy the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced mixture of 2D and 3D graphic assets with a slight paralax effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting scoring system adds to the fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique control system focused on handheld and joypad gaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for left-handed people</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAPHICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next generation  arcade game in a cute cartoon 3D world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay includes simple retro-arcade mechanics and modern competitive process. Interesting rounds, reworked levels, bonuses, enemies, bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique control system &quot;Smart and Convenient&quot; focused on handheld and joypad gaming. You can enjoy the game without a lightgun or mouse. Suitable for left-handed people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREDITS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Igor Bronnikov | programming, modeling, animation, level design, management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alisa Bronnikova | voice acting, gameplay advising, art design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleksandr Bronnikov | gameplay advising, product testing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danyl Vindiuk (danyvin) | music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eskoma, AlexM76, CuttlefishM, FxProSound, Sound-Ideas, sounddogs | SFX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCLAIMER</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny Duck Hunt 3D is not affiliated with, sponsored by, approved by, endorsed by, or in any way connected to Nintendo video game company or Duck Hunt (TM).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic hand eye coordination activity that's not as messy or too much when you want to relax and enjoy the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced mixture of 2D and 3D graphic assets with a slight paralax effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting scoring system adds to the fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique control system focused on handheld and joypad gaming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for left-handed people</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GRAPHICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next generation  arcade game in a cute cartoon 3D world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay includes simple retro-arcade mechanics and modern competitive process. Interesting rounds, reworked levels, bonuses, enemies, bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unique control system &quot;Smart and Convenient&quot; focused on handheld and joypad gaming. You can enjoy the game without a lightgun or mouse. Suitable for left-handed people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREDITS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Igor Bronnikov | programming, modeling, animation, level design, management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alisa Bronnikova | voice acting, gameplay advising, art design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aleksandr Bronnikov | gameplay advising, product testing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danyl Vindiuk (danyvin) | music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eskoma, AlexM76, CuttlefishM, FxProSound, Sound-Ideas, sounddogs | SFX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Next generation arcade game in a cute cartoon 3D world. Sweet graphics, nice gameplay, unique control system focused on handheld and joypad gaming.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127290/d431f67124af23f380932db2de030e886045bd07/header.jpg?t=1777559129", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127290/0ae1e41d3641e0026d2cd85af53b2ef5d9aa1e66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777559129", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127290/0ae1e41d3641e0026d2cd85af53b2ef5d9aa1e66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777559129", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated video card<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i